# Mod 2: breath to Amp at 100: the level follows the breath (dynamics), not just the gate
wait 200
tap SEL
tap SEL
expect view 7
spin K1 1
spin K2 2
expect par15 1
expect par16 2
spin K3 100
expect par17 100
shot mod2_amp.png
midi 90 39 64
midi B0 02 00
wait 100
expect amp 0
expect level 0
breath 0 127 50
wait 30
expect amp 100
expect level >5
breath 127 64 50
wait 30
expect amp 50
midi 80 39 00
wait 200
